  "snakeName": "Snake",
  "snakeTagline": "Eat the apples, grow longer, don't bite your tail",
  "snakeRules": "• The snake moves on its own. Swipe (or press an arrow key) to turn it.\n• Each apple makes it one cell longer and scores a point. It gets a little faster as it grows.\n• Running into a wall or into itself ends the run.\n• Tap the board (or press space) to pause, and swipe to go on.\n\nGoals\n• Free play: eat as many apples as you can, and beat your best score.\n• Apple target: eat the set number of apples (more on bigger boards and harder levels) without crashing.\n\nThe difficulty sets the speed.",
