  "junctionName": "Junction",
  "junctionTagline": "Flip the switches and send every train to its own station",
  "junctionRules": "• Trains come out of the tunnel one by one and run along the track on their own.\n• Every train carries a symbol, and its station has the same one.\n• At a switch the track splits in two. Tap a switch to flip it: the lever points at the branch the next train takes. A train takes the branch the switch is set to as it passes.\n• A train that reaches its own station scores; one that reaches another station is a miss.\n• Tap anywhere else on the board (or press space) to pause, and tap to go on.\n\nGoals\n• 20 trains: route a set number of trains and get as many as you can to their stations.\n• Timed: get as many trains to their stations as you can in two minutes.\n\nThe difficulty sets the speed, how often trains leave and how many stations there are; bigger boards have more switches.",
