  "turnaboutName": "Turnabout",
  "turnaboutTagline": "Race a rival to the star through a maze that keeps turning",
  "turnaboutRules": "• You and a rival start in opposite corners of a maze, with a star between you, just as far from both.\n• Swipe (or press an arrow key) to move one cell; keep the swipe going to move on. The rival runs the shortest way at its own pace.\n• Every few seconds the whole maze makes a quarter turn (on hard sometimes a half turn). An arrow warns you just before. Your moves stay on screen: up is always up on the screen.\n• Whoever reaches the star first wins the round. Every round is a new maze.\n• Tap the board (or press space) to pause.\n\nGoals\n• 5 rounds: win as many rounds as you can.\n• 3 lives: play on until the rival has won three rounds; it gets a little faster as you win.\n\nThe difficulty sets the rival's pace, the mazes and how often they turn.",
